1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
@CafeMusicalScene

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,300
[Girl]{Voice:teasing}阿澈，再画下去，咖啡都凉了。

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:10,700
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}先别动。你的影子正好到这里。

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:14,000
[Girl]{Voice:teasing}我的影子都坐累了。

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
{Event:CeramicPickup}

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
[Girl]{Voice:bright}接一句？

7
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,400
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}唱还行，跳不会。

8
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,000
{Event:SunlightPause}

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:01:14,000
{Event:CafeDuet}

10
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:17,000
[Girl]{Voice:teasing}不是说不会跳？

11
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:20,800
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}我只跟了你半步。

12
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:24,200
[Girl]{Voice:amused}咖啡真的凉了。

13
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:27,300
[Boy]{Voice:gentle}正好，现在能喝了。

14
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:30,000
{Event:CafeCoda}
